Victor Manuel Diaz is taken by ICE and transferred within a week to  [LINK: (Camp East Montana) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Camp_East_Montana] , a detention center at  [LINK: (Fort Bliss, Texas) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fort_Bliss,_Texas] . [LINK: ([57]) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Operation_Metro_Surge#cite_note-VictorMD-AP-57]

January 7
Renée Good is  [LINK: (shot and killed in her car) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Killing_of_Ren%C3%A9e_Good]  by federal agents.
A resident of St Paul's North End neighborhood said that federal agents knocked on her door asking her to identify houses in her neighborhood where  [LINK: (Hmong) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hmong_people]  families lived. [LINK: ([58]) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Operation_Metro_Surge#cite_note-:2-58] 
A Minneapolis pastor was detained by ICE during a protest near his church. He said that agents invoked his race in determining that he would be released shortly after arrest. [LINK: ([59]) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Operation_Metro_Surge#cite_note-59] 
Health care workers and organizers said ICE entered a Minneapolis hospital without a warrant and guarded/handcuffed a patient to a bed, raising concerns about interference with care and access to private areas. [LINK: ([60]) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Operation_Metro_Surge#cite_note-60] 
Federal agents tackled people and used chemical irritants and detained an educator [LINK: ([61]) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Operation_Metro_Surge#cite_note-61]  outside  [LINK: (Roosevelt High School) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Roosevelt_High_School_(Minnesota)]  in Minneapolis. Eyewitnesses said the agents were hitting people who were already on the ground.  [LINK: (Minneapolis Public Schools) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Minneapolis_Public_Schools]  subsequently canceled classes for the remainder of the week. [LINK: ([62]) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Operation_Metro_Surge#cite_note-62]

Renée Good is  [LINK: (shot and killed in her car) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Killing_of_Ren%C3%A9e_Good]  by federal agents.

