January 15
A couple reported having ICE agents deploy tear gas and stun grenades around their car as they were stuck near a protest, resulting in the hospitalization of their six children inside. [LINK: ([80]) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Operation_Metro_Surge#cite_note-80]  [LINK: ([81]) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Operation_Metro_Surge#cite_note-81]  [LINK: ([82]) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Operation_Metro_Surge#cite_note-82] 
ICE detained several workers at a Mexican restaurant in  [LINK: (Willmar, Minnesota) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Willmar,_Minnesota] . The officers ate at the restaurant earlier in the day, then returned to arrest the employees after they closed. [LINK: ([27]) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Operation_Metro_Surge#cite_note-:17-27] 
St. Paul Public Schools reported ICE stopped two of its contract vans transporting students and staff. [LINK: ([83]) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Operation_Metro_Surge#cite_note-83]

