January 17
Jake Lang, a pardoned  [LINK: (January 6) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/January_6_United_States_Capitol_attack]  rioter, attempts to burn a Quran in front of a government building and march through the streets of a Somali neighborhood, but is disrupted and attacked by counterprotesters. [LINK: ([84]) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Operation_Metro_Surge#cite_note-84]

