January 22
Federal agents detained an immigrant man and his 2-year-old daughter, who had active asylum cases, as they were returning from grocery shopping. When a crowd gathered, the agents used flash-bang grenades and chemical agents. Despite a federal court order for the toddler's release, both were transferred to Texas. The 2-year-old was later returned to her mother. [LINK: ([40]) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Operation_Metro_Surge#cite_note-:27-40]

