[LINK: (^) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Operation_Metro_Surge#cite_ref-107]  At the time of the shooting, Ross worked as an officer under the  [LINK: (Office of Enforcement and Removal Operations) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Office_of_Enforcement_and_Removal_Operations]  (ERO) of ICE, which is the directorate in charge of detentions and deportations. ICE agent is commonly used by English-language speakers and media to refer to ERO officers. Ross was identified by cross-referencing statements made by federal officials concerning a dragging incident the shooter was involved in with court documents. [LINK: ([104]) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Operation_Metro_Surge#cite_note-Killing_of_Renée_Good_Sawyer-2026-104]  His name had not been released by federal authorities. [LINK: ([105]) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Operation_Metro_Surge#cite_note-Killing_of_Renée_Good_Chapman-2026-105]  [LINK: ([106]) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Operation_Metro_Surge#cite_note-Killing_of_Renée_Good_Sacchetti-2026-106]


